<%-
  _rlib   = context.respond_to?('r_libpath') ? context.r_libpath.to_s : ''
  _img    = context.respond_to?('imagefile') ? context.imagefile.to_s : ''
  _image  = _img.empty? ? '' : "/shared/apptainerImages/#{_img}"
-%>
# NOT INSTALLED BY A SESSION. Kept here as the model for what provisioning
# writes into the course folder, and so the values can still be rendered from
# the form while provisionRStudioCourse.sh is being written. Delete this file
# once that script owns it.
#
# These are the only two values a batch job needs that differ between courses.
# They live in the COURSE FOLDER rather than inside run-r-job.sh so that a
# student's own copy of that script cannot go stale: the wrapper reads this file
# every time it runs, so changing the image or the library here reaches every
# copy at once - including copies taken months earlier.
IMAGE=<%= _image %>
R_LIB=<%= _rlib %>
